WEBVTT

00:05:29.583 --> 00:05:32.333
They just want another human
to connect to them.

00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:35.893
As we sat together,

00:05:35.917 --> 00:05:40.309
she asked me one question
over and over and over again.

00:05:40.333 --> 00:05:43.309
"What am I supposed to tell my kids?"

00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:46.726
One of the most important parts
of respecting space

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.768
is not always having to have an answer.

00:05:49.792 --> 00:05:53.059
I could feel she didn't want me
to answer that question.

00:05:53.083 --> 00:05:55.726
She didn't want me to try to fix
that unfixable moment.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:59.393
She wanted me to connect
to the depth of that experience

00:05:59.417 --> 00:06:01.018
she was going through.